tml\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n14:Tbf1,\\u003ch1\\u003eCOB LED Technology Explained: Why It Matters\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBlog — Cob Led Technology Explained. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eChip-on-Board LED delivers superior durability, anti-glare performance, and close-viewing quality. Understanding the advantages.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cdiv\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eWhat is COB?\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eCOB (Chip-on-Board) technology represents a significant advancement over traditional SMD LED packaging. Instead of mounting individual LED chips in protective housings, COB integrates multiple chips directly onto the substrate and covers them with a protective resin layer.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eKey Advantages\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDurability:\\u003c/strong\\u003e COB displays are significantly more resistant to physical damage. There are no protruding LED lenses to break off, making them ideal for high-traffic areas.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eAnti-Glare:\\u003c/strong\\u003e The matte surface finish reduces reflections, making COB displays more comfortable to view in bright environments or at close distances.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eContrast:\\u003c/strong\\u003e The black surface between pixels delivers superior contrast ratios compared to SMD displays.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\n\\u003ch3\\u003eBest Applications\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eCOB technology excels in:\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eCorporate meeting rooms with close viewing\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eControl rooms requiring extended viewing sessions\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRetail environments with customer interaction\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eAny installation requiring maximum durability\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat is COB LED technology and how does it work in LED displays?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCOB (Chip-on-Board) LED technology involves mounting multiple LED chips directly onto a substrate and coating them with a protective resin, unlike traditional SMD LEDs with separate housings. This integration enhances durability and enables a more uniform light output, making it ideal for high-quality LED displays in the UAE and GCC regions.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhy is COB LED technology considered better for outdoor LED screens in hot climates like Dubai?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCOB LED displays offer superior heat dissipation and durability, reducing the risk of damage from extreme temperatures common in the UAE and GCC. Their anti-glare matte finish also improves visibility in bright sunlight, making them suitable for outdoor advertising and public information screens.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the anti-glare feature of COB LEDs improve viewing experience in the Middle East?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe matte surface of COB LEDs reduces reflections, minimizing glare from intense sunlight prevalent in the GCC. This results in more comfortable close-distance viewing and clearer image quality, enhancing user experience in retail or public spaces across the region.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the cost differences between COB and traditional SMD LED displays for businesses in the UAE?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWhile COB LED displays may have a slightly higher upfront cost due to advanced manufacturing, they typically offer better durability and lower maintenance expenses. For UAE businesses, this translates into long-term savings, especially in harsh environments where robustness and reduced downtime are critical.\\u003c/p\\u003e13:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$14\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Blog — Cob Led Technology Explained | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Blog — Cob Led Technology Explained. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/cob-led-technology-explained\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"blog\",\"cob-led-technology-explained\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"blog/cob-led-technology-explained\",\"c\",[\"products\"]],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4624],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"children\":\"404 — Page Not Found\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The page you requested does not exist.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/products\",\"children\":\"Browse products\"}]}]]}],[]],\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}]}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}]]}],{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[\"$L5\",null,[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$7\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@8\"}]}]]}],{},null,false,null]},null,false,\"$9\"]},null,false,null],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"children\":\"$Lb\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$7\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$Ld\"}]}]}],null]}],false]],\"m\":\"$undefined\",\"G\":[\"$e\",[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]]],\"S\":true,\"h\":null,\"r\":\"$undefined\",\"s\":\"$undefined\",\"a\":\"$undefined\",\"l\":\"$undefined\",\"p\":\"$undefined\",\"d\":\"$undefined\",\"b\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n9:C\nf:Td65,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is COB LED technology and how does it work in LED displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"COB (Chip-on-Board) LED technology involves mounting multiple LED chips directly onto a substrate and coating them with a protective resin, unlike traditional SMD LEDs with separate housings. This integration enhances durability and enables a more uniform light output, making it ideal for high-quality LED displays in the UAE and GCC regions.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why is COB LED technology considered better for outdoor LED screens in hot climates like Dubai?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"COB LED displays offer superior heat dissipation and durability, reducing the risk of damage from extreme temperatures common in the UAE and GCC. Their anti-glare matte finish also improves visibility in bright sunlight, making them suitable for outdoor advertising and public information screens.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the anti-glare feature of COB LEDs improve viewing experience in the Middle East?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The matte surface of COB LEDs reduces reflections, minimizing glare from intense sunlight prevalent in the GCC. This results in more comfortable close-distance viewing and clearer image quality, enhancing user experience in retail or public spaces across the region.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the cost differences between COB and traditional SMD LED displays for businesses in the UAE?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"While COB LED displays may have a slightly higher upfront cost due to advanced manufacturing, they typically offer better durability and lower maintenance expenses. For UAE businesses, this translates into long-term savings, especially in harsh environments where robustness and reduced downtime are critical.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the improved contrast ratio in COB LED technology benefit digital signage in the GCC?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"COB displays feature a black substrate between pixels, which enhances contrast ratios and delivers deeper blacks and vibrant colors. This is especially beneficial for digital signage in the GCC, improving readability and attracting more attention in busy urban environments like Dubai and Abu Dhabi.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Why should companies in the Middle East consider COB LED technology for indoor high-traffic areas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Due to its high durability and resistance to physical damage, COB LED technology is ideal for indoor locations with heavy foot traffic such as malls and airports common in the GCC. Its anti-glare properties also ensure excellent visibility without eye strain, enhancing overall customer engagement.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does COB LED technology impact the lifespan and maintenance of LED displays in the GCC region?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"COB LEDs have a longer lifespan owing to their robust design and protective resin layer, which shields the chips from dust and moisture prevalent in desert climates. This reduces maintenance frequency and costs for businesses in the GCC, making COB a reliable choice for long-term LED display investments.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Article\\\", \\\"headline\\\": \\\"COB LED Technology Explained: Why It Matters\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"Chip-on-Board LED delivers superior durability, anti-glare performance, and close-viewing quality. Understanding the advantages.\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/cob-led-technology-explained\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/downloaded-images_blog_8fdb2db9_cob-led-technology-e.jpg\\\", \\\"author\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"publisher\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}, \\\"datePublished\\\": \\\"2026-03-11\\\", \\\"dateModified\\\": \\\"2026-08-09\\\", \\\"articleSection\\\": \\\"LED Display Technology\\\"}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\"],\"$L13\"]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Blog\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"COB LED Technology Explained: Why It Matters\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/cob-led-technology-explained\\\"}]}\"}}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:Tbf1,<h1>COB LED Technology Explained: Why It Matters</h1><p>Blog — Cob Led Technology Explained. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.</p><p>Chip-on-Board LED delivers superior durability, anti-glare performance, and close-viewing quality. Understanding the advantages.</p><div><h2>What is COB?</h2>\n<p>COB (Chip-on-Board) technology represents a significant advancement over traditional SMD LED packaging. Instead of mounting individual LED chips in protective housings, COB integrates multiple chips directly onto the substrate and covers them with a protective resin layer.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Advantages</h3>\n<p><strong>Durability:</strong> COB displays are significantly more resistant to physical damage. There are no protruding LED lenses to break off, making them ideal for high-traffic areas.</p>\n<p><strong>Anti-Glare:</strong> The matte surface finish reduces reflections, making COB displays more comfortable to view in bright environments or at close distances.</p>\n<p><strong>Contrast:</strong> The black surface between pixels delivers superior contrast ratios compared to SMD displays.</p>\n\n<h3>Best Applications</h3>\n<p>COB technology excels in:\n<ul>\n<li>Corporate meeting rooms with close viewing</li>\n<li>Control rooms requiring extended viewing sessions</li>\n<li>Retail environments with customer interaction</li>\n<li>Any installation requiring maximum durability</li>\n</ul></p></div><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is COB LED technology and how does it work in LED displays?</h3><p>COB (Chip-on-Board) LED technology involves mounting multiple LED chips directly onto a substrate and coating them with a protective resin, unlike traditional SMD LEDs with separate housings. This integration enhances durability and enables a more uniform light output, making it ideal for high-quality LED displays in the UAE and GCC regions.</p><h3>Why is COB LED technology considered better for outdoor LED screens in hot climates like Dubai?</h3><p>COB LED displays offer superior heat dissipation and durability, reducing the risk of damage from extreme temperatures common in the UAE and GCC. Their anti-glare matte finish also improves visibility in bright sunlight, making them suitable for outdoor advertising and public information screens.</p><h3>How does the anti-glare feature of COB LEDs improve viewing experience in the Middle East?</h3><p>The matte surface of COB LEDs reduces reflections, minimizing glare from intense sunlight prevalent in the GCC. This results in more comfortable close-distance viewing and clearer image quality, enhancing user experience in retail or public spaces across the region.</p><h3>What are the cost differences between COB and traditional SMD LED displays for businesses in the UAE?</h3><p>While COB LED displays may have a slightly higher upfront cost due to advanced manufacturing, they typically offer better durability and lower maintenance expenses. For UAE businesses, this translates into long-term savings, especially in harsh environments where robustness and reduced downtime are critical.</p>13:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Blog — Cob Led Technology Explained | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Blog — Cob Led Technology Explained. Premium LED display solutions by Brightluxx in Dubai, UAE.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/blog/cob-led-technology-explained\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"blog/cob-led-technology-explained\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I